          <img class="subnavbar__thumbnail-img" src="img/nav/Cranberry.png" />
          <h3 class="subnavbar__thumbnail-header">Yogurt & Cranberry Cubes</h3>
        </a>
        <a class="subnavbar__thumbnail grid__col-sm-4" href="product-25.html">
          <img class="subnavbar__thumbnail-img" src="img/nav/Yolk.png" />
          <h3 class="subnavbar__thumbnail-header">Chicken & Yolk Cubes</h3>
